%% CloudWatch Logs subscription filter flow
%% Author: Prem Vishnoi <pvishnoi@avilx.com>
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Application<br/>(EC2 / Lambda / ECS)
    participant CW as CloudWatch Logs<br/>Log Group
    participant SF as Subscription Filter<br/>(filter pattern)
    participant KDS as Kinesis Data Stream
    participant KDF as Kinesis Data Firehose<br/>(optional)
    participant Con as Consumer<br/>(Lambda / OpenSearch / S3)

    App->>CW: PutLogEvents
    Note over CW: 2 destinations max per<br/>log group

    CW->>SF: Match each event against pattern
    alt pattern matches
        SF->>KDS: PutRecord
        KDS-->>KDF: (optional) buffer / transform / batch
        KDF->>Con: PutObject (S3) / Index (OpenSearch)
        Con->>Con: process, enrich, alert, archive
    else no match
        SF-->>CW: drop / skip
    end
